    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## All reported security findings\nThese tables include **all recommendation and detailed-finding types returned by Azure Resource Graph**, not only recommendations linked to attack paths. There is no fixed list of recommendation IDs or titles, so newer individual vulnerability recommendations are included when published. Healthy, unhealthy, not-applicable, and unknown states remain visible. Records from connected clouds are included when they are published at the selected subscription scopes.\n\nUse the server-side status selector and search to narrow by assessment state, recommendation, resource ID, vulnerability identifier, or any reported property. Each detail table displays at most **1,000 rows**; compare with the server-side totals and narrow subscriptions, status, or search when needed. The grid search filters only rows already returned. **No findings does not prove that a capability is enabled, supported, scanned, or healthy.**\n\nSettings cannot reliably identify which extension produced each finding, so these tables do not guess feature ownership from titles. API endpoint sensitive-information details, Cloud Security Explorer graph insights, and some serverless vulnerability experiences are available only in the product portals, not universally through Resource Graph. Use [API security findings](https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/defender-for-cloud/enable-api-security-posture), [serverless protection](https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/defender-for-cloud/serverless-protection), and [serverless container posture](https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/defender-for-cloud/posture-for-serverless-containers) for those investigations. Additional data can contain sensitive security context; review it before exporting."
      },
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "tab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "findings"
      },
      "name": "all_findings_guidance"
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "2118368a-f05e-4d21-9672-0fc0a1cefa9f",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "FindingStatus",
            "label": "Assessment status (server-side)",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "value": "All",
            "jsonData": "[{\"value\":\"All\",\"label\":\"All states\"},{\"value\":\"Unhealthy\",\"label\":\"Unhealthy\"},{\"value\":\"Healthy\",\"label\":\"Healthy\"},{\"value\":\"NotApplicable\",\"label\":\"Not applicable\"},{\"value\":\"Other\",\"label\":\"Other or unknown state\"}]"
          },
          {
            "id": "09bff57e-4e7e-4863-9bc5-27714d67a9dc",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "FindingSearch",
            "label": "Findings search (server-side)",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": false,
            "value": ""
          }
        ],
        "style": "above",
        "queryType": 1,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources"
      },
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "tab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "findings"
      },
      "name": "findings_search"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "title": "Server-side finding totals for this scope and search",
        "query": "securityresources\n| where type in~ (\"microsoft.security/assessments\", \"microsoft.security/assessments/subassessments\")\n| where \"{FindingStatus:escape}\" == \"All\" or tostring(properties.status.code) =~ \"{FindingStatus:escape}\"\n    or (\"{FindingStatus:escape}\" == \"Other\" and tostring(properties.status.code) !in~ (\"Unhealthy\", \"Healthy\", \"NotApplicable\"))\n| where isempty(\"{FindingSearch:escape}\") or id contains \"{FindingSearch:escape}\" or tostring(properties) contains \"{FindingSearch:escape}\"\n| extend FindingType = iff(type =~ \"microsoft.security/assessments\", \"Recommendations\", \"Detailed findings\")\n| summarize Total = count(), Unhealthy = countif(properties.status.code =~ \"Unhealthy\"),\n    Healthy = countif(properties.status.code =~ \"Healthy\"), NotApplicable = countif(properties.status.code =~ \"NotApplicable\"),\n    OtherOrUnknown = countif(tostring(properties.status.code) !in~ (\"Unhealthy\", \"Healthy\", \"NotApplicable\")) by FindingType\n| extend DisplayLimit = 1000, Notice = iff(Total > 1000, \"Results exceed the detail table limit. Narrow subscriptions or the server-side search.\", \"Compare these totals with displayed rows. No data does not prove coverage.\")\n| order by FindingType asc",
        "size": 1,
        "queryType": 1,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
        "crossComponentResources": [
          "{subscriptions}"
        ],
        "visualization": "table",
        "noDataMessage": "No assessment records matched this scope and search. Check access, data availability, and the search; this is not evidence of healthy coverage.",
        "gridSettings": {
          "filter": true,
          "rowLimit": 1000,
          "formatters": [],
          "labelSettings": [
            {
              "columnId": "FindingType",
              "label": "Record type"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "Total",
              "label": "Total matching records"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "Unhealthy",
              "label": "Unhealthy"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "Healthy",
              "label": "Healthy"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "NotApplicable",
              "label": "Not applicable"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "OtherOrUnknown",
              "label": "Other or unknown state"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "DisplayLimit",
              "label": "Detail table row limit"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "Notice",
              "label": "Completeness guidance"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "tab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "findings"
      },
      "name": "findings_counts",
      "styleSettings": {
        "showBorder": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "title": "All reported recommendations",
        "query": "securityresources\n| where type =~ \"microsoft.security/assessments\"\n| where \"{FindingStatus:escape}\" == \"All\" or tostring(properties.status.code) =~ \"{FindingStatus:escape}\"\n    or (\"{FindingStatus:escape}\" == \"Other\" and tostring(properties.status.code) !in~ (\"Unhealthy\", \"Healthy\", \"NotApplicable\"))\n| where isempty(\"{FindingSearch:escape}\") or id contains \"{FindingSearch:escape}\" or tostring(properties) contains \"{FindingSearch:escape}\"\n| extend Recommendation = tostring(properties.displayName), Status = coalesce(tostring(properties.status.code), \"Not reported\"),\n    Severity = coalesce(tostring(properties.metadata.severity), \"Not reported\"),\n    RiskLevel = coalesce(tostring(properties.risk.level), \"Not reported\"),\n    Source = coalesce(tostring(properties.resourceDetails.Source), tostring(properties.resourceDetails.source), \"Not reported\"),\n    ResourceId = coalesce(tostring(properties.resourceDetails.Id), tostring(properties.resourceDetails.id),\n        tostring(properties.resourceDetails.NativeResourceId), tostring(properties.resourceDetails.AwsResourceId), tostring(properties.resourceDetails.GcpResourceId))\n| extend statusOrder = case(Status =~ \"Unhealthy\", 0, Status =~ \"Healthy\", 2, Status =~ \"NotApplicable\", 3, 1),\n    riskOrder = case(RiskLevel =~ \"Critical\", 0, RiskLevel =~ \"High\", 1, RiskLevel =~ \"Medium\", 2, RiskLevel =~ \"Low\", 3, 4)\n| order by statusOrder asc, riskOrder asc, Recommendation asc, id asc\n| project subscriptionId, Recommendation, Status, Severity, RiskLevel, Source, ResourceId,\n    RecommendationId = name, AssessmentId = id, Risk = properties.risk, ResourceDetails = properties.resourceDetails,\n    AdditionalData = properties.additionalData, PortalLink = tostring(properties.links.azurePortal)\n| take 1000",
        "size": 1,
        "queryType": 1,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
        "crossComponentResources": [
          "{subscriptions}"
        ],
        "visualization": "table",
        "noDataMessage": "No recommendations matched. Review the search, permissions, plan configuration, and data availability; no data is not a healthy result.",
        "gridSettings": {
          "filter": true,
          "rowLimit": 1000,
          "formatters": [
            {
              "columnMatch": "subscriptionId",
              "formatter": 15,
              "formatOptions": {
                "showIcon": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "labelSettings": [
            {
              "columnId": "subscriptionId",
              "label": "Subscription"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "Recommendation",
              "label": "Recommendation"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "Status",
              "label": "Assessment status"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "Severity",
              "label": "Severity"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "RiskLevel",
              "label": "Risk level"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "Source",
              "label": "Cloud source"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "ResourceId",
              "label": "Reported resource ID"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "RecommendationId",
              "label": "Recommendation key"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "AssessmentId",
              "label": "Assessment ID"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "Risk",
              "label": "Risk details"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "ResourceDetails",
              "label": "Resource details"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "AdditionalData",
              "label": "Additional findings and context"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "PortalLink",
              "label": "Recommendation portal link"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "tab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "findings"
      },
      "name": "all_recommendations",
      "styleSettings": {
        "showBorder": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "title": "All reported detailed findings",
        "query": "securityresources\n| where type =~ \"microsoft.security/assessments/subassessments\"\n| where \"{FindingStatus:escape}\" == \"All\" or tostring(properties.status.code) =~ \"{FindingStatus:escape}\"\n    or (\"{FindingStatus:escape}\" == \"Other\" and tostring(properties.status.code) !in~ (\"Unhealthy\", \"Healthy\", \"NotApplicable\"))\n| where isempty(\"{FindingSearch:escape}\") or id contains \"{FindingSearch:escape}\" or tostring(properties) contains \"{FindingSearch:escape}\"\n| extend Finding = tostring(properties.displayName), Status = coalesce(tostring(properties.status.code), \"Not reported\"),\n    Severity = coalesce(tostring(properties.status.severity), \"Not reported\"),\n    Source = coalesce(tostring(properties.resourceDetails.source), tostring(properties.resourceDetails.Source), \"Not reported\"),\n    ResourceId = coalesce(tostring(properties.resourceDetails.id), tostring(properties.resourceDetails.Id),\n        tostring(properties.resourceDetails.NativeResourceId), tostring(properties.resourceDetails.AwsResourceId), tostring(properties.resourceDetails.GcpResourceId))\n| extend statusOrder = case(Status =~ \"Unhealthy\", 0, Status =~ \"Healthy\", 2, Status =~ \"NotApplicable\", 3, 1),\n    severityOrder = case(Severity =~ \"Critical\", 0, Severity =~ \"High\", 1, Severity =~ \"Medium\", 2, Severity =~ \"Low\", 3, 4)\n| order by statusOrder asc, severityOrder asc, Finding asc, id asc\n| project subscriptionId, Finding, Status, Severity, Source, ResourceId,\n    RecommendationId = extract(\"(?i)/assessments/([^/]+)/subassessments/\", 1, id),\n    FindingId = id, ResourceDetails = properties.resourceDetails, AdditionalData = properties.additionalData,\n    Remediation = tostring(properties.remediation), TimeGenerated = todatetime(properties.timeGenerated)\n| take 1000",
        "size": 1,
        "queryType": 1,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
        "crossComponentResources": [
          "{subscriptions}"
        ],
        "visualization": "table",
        "noDataMessage": "No detailed findings matched. Newer findings can be individual recommendations instead of subassessments; check the recommendation table and product portals.",
        "gridSettings": {
          "filter": true,
          "rowLimit": 1000,
          "formatters": [
            {
              "columnMatch": "subscriptionId",
              "formatter": 15,
              "formatOptions": {
                "showIcon": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "labelSettings": [
            {
              "columnId": "subscriptionId",
              "label": "Subscription"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "Finding",
              "label": "Finding"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "Status",
              "label": "Finding status"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "Severity",
              "label": "Severity"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "Source",
              "label": "Cloud source"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "ResourceId",
              "label": "Reported resource ID"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "RecommendationId",
              "label": "Parent recommendation key"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "FindingId",
